OL,3,GNEWSARestaurant boss banned over #363k 
OL,4,Afurlough claims                        
OL,6,FThe co-founder of a restaurant has been
OL,7,Fbanned from acting as a company        
OL,8,Fdirector for five years after his      
OL,9,Fcompany failed to account for over     
OL,10,F#363,000 in furlough payments during   
OL,11,Fthe coronavirus pandemic, the          
OL,12,FInsolvency Service said.               
OL,14,FPatrick Hall, 45, helped establish The 
OL,15,FLaundrette in Chorlton, Manchester,    
OL,16,Fwhich closed in 2025 after 12 years in 
OL,17,Fbusiness, citing "rising costs and     
OL,18,Finsufficient government support".      
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
