OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4   
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSARestaurant boss banned over #363k 
OL,4,Afurlough claims                        
OL,6,FThe Insolvency Service said Winchester 
OL,7,FServices Limited, which ran the        
OL,8,Frestaurant, repeatedly failed to       
OL,9,Fprovide evidence that it was entitled  
OL,10,Fto the payments.                       
OL,12,FHall, from Levenshulme, agreed to a    
OL,13,Fdisqualification undertaking and a     
OL,14,Ffive-year ban.                         
